      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3ad761d4",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who hold xenophobic, anti-refugee, or right-wing populist views, likely drawn to hateful rhetoric that dehumanizes refugees by equating them to undesirable, inedible food. This audience may be receptive to stereotypes portraying refugees as burdensome, lazy, or unwelcome, and may be influenced by nationalist or isolationist ideologies that frame immigration as a threat to national identity or economic stability. The meme’s use of a dehumanizing food metaphor appeals to those who use simplistic, visceral analogies to justify prejudice against vulnerable populations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2c95b02a"
